v0.1 v0.2 slds.service / Service slds.interactor / slds.Interactor new{repository,generator,encoder} new{repository,code_generator?} slds.ACTIVE / DISABLED / DELETED slds.Lifecycle.ACTIVE / DISABLED / DELETED slds.CONFLICT / INVALID slds.Errors.CONFLICT / INVALID Errors.EXPIRED / DISABLED / DELETED Resolution.EXPIRED / Lifecycle.DISABLED / DELETED Core Generator/Encoder ports Adapter-internal components; Core CodeGenerator port <p>Wrap the existing Sequential/Base62 pair:</p> <pre><code>local code_generator = require("slds.adapters.composed.code_generator").new({
    generator = require("slds.adapters.sequential.generator").new(),
    encoders = { require("slds.adapters.base62.encoder").new() },
})
local interactor = require("slds").new({ repository = repository, code_generator = code_generator })
</code></pre> <p>If every create supplies Code, omit code_generator. Only code==nil invokes it; empty/wrong-type Code is INVALID. Generation receives ctx,input and returns final non-empty Code. Core no longer prefixes generation/encoding errors and never retries conflicts.</p>
